 # Reactions
 
-Reactions are short (16-character max) responses to comments.
+Reactions (also known as boosts) are short (16-character max) responses to cards and comments.
+
+## Card reactions
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions`
+
+Returns a list of reactions on a card. The response has the same shape as for comment reactions (see below),
+with each reaction `url` pointing to `/:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions/:reaction_id`.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions`
+
+Adds a reaction to a card.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `content` | string | Yes | The reaction text |
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` on success, with the reaction in the body.
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions/:reaction_id`
+
+Removes your reaction from a card.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## Comment reactions
 
 ## `GET /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/comments/:comment_id/reactions`
 
